# A card type word or a subtype word is a nominal: "creature" in "creature card" is the word
# the head "creature" is. With no zone and no "card", "spell" or "source" in its description, it
# means a permanent of that type on the battlefield [CR#109.2]; which is meant is read from where
# the word stands.
member(CardType): Nominal
member(Subtype): Nominal
